@KidTracking.API_HostAddress = http://localhost:5000

### Test Authentication
POST {{KidTracking.API_HostAddress}}/api/authentication/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "Email": "manager@facility1.com",
    "Password": "password123"
}

### 

### ===============================
### SCHEDULE SLOT TESTS
### ===============================

@token = {{login.response.body.$.token}}

### 1. Get All Slots (Admin only)
GET {{KidTracking.API_HostAddress}}/api/scheduleslots
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 2. Get My Facility Slots (Manager/Staff/Doctor/Member)
GET {{KidTracking.API_HostAddress}}/api/scheduleslots/my-facility
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 3. Get Slots by Facility ID (Admin/Member)
GET {{KidTracking.API_HostAddress}}/api/scheduleslots/facility/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 4. Get Slot by ID
GET {{KidTracking.API_HostAddress}}/api/scheduleslots/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 🔥 CREATE Working Hours Slots - Tạo slots tự động
POST {{KidTracking.API_HostAddress}}/api/scheduleslots
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "startTime": "08:00",
  "endTime": "17:00",
  "slotDurationMinutes": 60,
  "lunchBreakStart": "12:00",
  "lunchBreakEnd": "13:00",
  "maxCapacity": 20,
  "status": "Available"
}

### 🔥 CREATE Working Hours Slots - Không có lunch break
POST {{KidTracking.API_HostAddress}}/api/scheduleslots
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "startTime": "09:00",
  "endTime": "16:00",
  "slotDurationMinutes": 30,
  "maxCapacity": 15,
  "status": "Available"
}

### 🔥 CREATE Working Hours Slots - Slot 2 tiếng
POST {{KidTracking.API_HostAddress}}/api/scheduleslots
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "startTime": "08:00",
  "endTime": "18:00",
  "slotDurationMinutes": 120,
  "lunchBreakStart": "12:00",
  "lunchBreakEnd": "13:00",
  "maxCapacity": 50,
  "status": "Available"
}

### ===============================
### WORKING HOURS GROUP MANAGEMENT
### ===============================

### 🔥 GET Working Hours Groups - Lấy tất cả working hours groups
GET {{KidTracking.API_HostAddress}}/api/scheduleslots/working-hours-groups
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 🔥 GET Slots by Working Hours Group - Lấy slots theo GroupId
GET {{KidTracking.API_HostAddress}}/api/scheduleslots/working-hours-groups/WH_1_20250125_12345678/slots
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 7. Update Slot (Manager only)
PUT {{KidTracking.API_HostAddress}}/api/scheduleslots/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "MaxCapacity": 15,
    "Status": "Available"
}

### 8. Update Slot Status (Manager only)
PUT {{KidTracking.API_HostAddress}}/api/scheduleslots/1/status
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

"Unavailable"

### 9. Delete Single Slot (Manager only)
DELETE {{KidTracking.API_HostAddress}}/api/scheduleslots/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 10. Delete Multiple Slots (Manager only)
DELETE {{KidTracking.API_HostAddress}}/api/scheduleslots/batch
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

[1, 2, 3, 4, 5]
